These will also go on sale starting at 21:00 tonight.

410
00:52:49,481 --> 00:52:54,341
続いて会場のエリアマップはこちらでん！じゃん！じゃじゃじゃーん！
Next, here is the venue area map! Ta-da! Tada-tada-da!

411
